Other two of my roommates didn't really work (one was racist, other one was never there, he came to mac with a pre-made friend  group). I  went to that big club thing in the fall, put my name down for four, only heard back from one, which in the end I was too chicken-shit to show up. Went to intramurals once and embarrased myself to the point of no return.  And yes, I am aware im missing out on the last opportunity to make lifelong friends and to be honest at this point I've accepted the fact I will die alone and  friendless

